# I04.var03 v1.0.0 routing NO_GO clarification

This addendum qualifies the last sentence of `i04-var03-independent-publication-routing-no-go-20261008.md` (SHA-256 `b5450f5c3693ac388755c2b7275f08c16f3d7009f6c998bc5db1526248a46378`). The frozen v1.0.0 candidate had **GO_PURE_PREFLIGHT only**. No actual case SSH preflight, GO_PRELAUNCH, or native approval existed. Thus there is no native launch approval to inherit. A v1.0.1 prospective candidate requires its own contract, source freeze, actual zero-native SSH5 preflight and independent GO_PRELAUNCH.
